Polyglot Language Learning App: Product Requirements & Functional Specification
1. Executive Summary & Vision
Product Overview
Polyglot is a streamlined, pedagogy-driven language learning mobile and web application inspired by the 'Polyglot 16' methodology. The application focuses on rapid conversational mastery by systematically automating core grammar matrices and facilitating active sentence synthesis.
Core Educational Philosophy
Rather than relying on the rote memorization of disconnected phrasebooks, Polyglot trains learners to internalize structural grammar paradigms—specifically verb conjugation matrices—until sentence generation transitions from conscious calculation to an automatic reflex.
Target Audience
* Primary Target: Beginners to intermediate language learners seeking an efficient, low-friction, and rule-grounded pathway to practical fluency.
* User Profile: Learners who value structured system mechanics, clear grammatical frameworks, and deliberate practice over gamified distractions.


