6. Implementation Roadmap
Phase 1: MVP Core
* Core infrastructure implementation (Lessons 1–4).
* Vocabulary drill engine with immediate feedback loop.
* Interactive 3x3 Verb Conjugation matrix viewer.
* Basic tile-unscrambling sentence practice engine.
Phase 2: Full Curriculum & Offline Persistence
* Expansion to complete 16-lesson curriculum catalog.
* Local storage persistence layer for offline learning session caching.
* Spaced-repetition scheduling algorithm integration for incorrect vocabulary and sentence patterns.
Phase 3: Advanced Audio & Voice Synthesizer
* Native audio playback for all vocabulary items and target practice sentences.
* Speech-to-text integration for real-time oral sentence production evaluation.